answer_units.text:
`output_file` must contain JSON in this form. `stages` must be nonempty even for a single-stage solution:

```json
{
  "stages": [
    {"pots": [
      {
        "pot_id": 1,
        "initial_round": 0,
        "rounds": [
          {"product": "A", "batch": 1, "cumulative_time": 60}
        ]
      }
    ]}
  ]
}
```
